{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.940000534057617,"text":"Black-and-white photographs of the performance in the ancient theater. Dozens of figures in long, woven clothes, lined up in the orchestra with the mountain behind them. There were no lights and no microphones. The performance took place in daylight, and the voices carried the way they had carried two-and-a-half thousand years before, because of the shape of the theater. The photographs also show the audience on the stone steps, many of them in their working clothes.","words":[{"word":"Black","start":0,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"and","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"white","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.059999942779541},{"word":"photographs","start":1.059999942779541,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"of","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"the","start":1.899999976158142,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"performance","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.4800000190734863},{"word":"in","start":2.4800000190734863,"end":2.7200000286102295},{"word":"the","start":2.7200000286102295,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"ancient","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"theater","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.4800000190734863},{"word":"Dozens","start":4.440000057220459,"end":4.440000057220459},{"word":"of","start":4.440000057220459,"end":4.820000171661377},{"word":"figures","start":4.820000171661377,"end":5.039999961853027},{"word":"in","start":5.039999961853027,"end":5.420000076293945},{"word":"long","start":5.420000076293945,"end":5.860000133514404},{"word":"woven","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"clothes","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"lined","start":7.159999847412109,"end":7.239999771118164},{"word":"up","start":7.239999771118164,"end":7.440000057220459},{"word":"in","start":7.440000057220459,"end":7.539999961853027},{"word":"the","start":7.53999996185302